WEBVTT


1
00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:04.080
Too many people all over Europe die from fires each year.

2
00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.800
We here in the Czech Republic support this European wide

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:12.080
campaign to encourage home owners to install smoke alarms

4
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.160
inside their homes.

5
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.120
It will really help to save more lives.

6
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:21.120
Installing some alarms will make a real difference.

7
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:23.600
Install smoke alarms today.